Make sure your environment is ready:

Packages: all dependencies are declared in pyproject.toml. Run uv sync to install them.
Environment variables: create a .env file at the root of the project with the following variables:
MLFLOW_TRACKING_URI=&lt;add the MLflow server URL&gt;
MLFLOW_RUN_ID=&lt;add the run ID&gt;
torchtextclassifiers: this notebook relies on the torchtextclassifiers library developped by INSEE. Refer to its GitHub for full API documentation.
